          </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="hero-panel" aria-label="Key focus areas">
          <div class="panel-kicker">Learning focus</div>
          <div class="stat-list">
            <div class="stat-item">
              <div class="stat-number">3</div>
              <p>Main sentence types to master: simple, compound, and complex.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <div class="stat-number">25+</div>
              <p>Examples across the guide to show patterns from easy to advanced.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <div class="stat-number">15</div>
              <p>Practice and challenge tasks to help you prepare for tests and assessments.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
